{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103520","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103520","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710352001:0":{"text":"あ、あなたは……ペギー殿下！？なぜ殿下がこのような場所に？","source_cn":"是……是佩吉公主？！殿下！您怎么也会在这个鬼地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8425C59AEB48F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710352002:1":{"text":"ペギー様！ああ、デューラ様に感謝！どうか助けてください！鎧が、鎧が動き出したんです！","source_cn":"公主殿下！感谢艾雅！救救我们！外面那些盔甲……它们活了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAACC6C30910CFABB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710352003:1":{"text":"『サバンナ・デイリー』の編集長を務めているルドルフと申します。先ほどは取り乱してしまい、大変失礼いたしました……","source_cn":"公主殿下，鄙人乃《赛凡纳晨报》的主编伦道夫。请恕我们失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2F4F9A80E817013","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710352004:1":{"text":"こんな時に礼儀なんて気にしないわよ。それよりも、あなたたちはどうしてここに？入り口は塞がれているはずでしょう？","source_cn":"现在不是多礼的时候。你们……是怎么进来的？大门明明已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB18822550221DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710352005:1":{"text":"そ、それが、分からないのです。庭でお茶会を開いていたのですが、紅茶を飲もうとしたら……","source_cn":"这……我也不知道。我正在花园里举办茶会，刚端起一杯红茶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A1D8FECCA76D7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710352006:1":{"text":"庭も、周りの人たちも、一瞬で消えてしまって……気がついたら、私ひとりだけが、こんな恐ろしい場所に……！","source_cn":"眨眼之间，花园没了，客人们也没了，而我孤身一人来到了这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCA06487F8BF106F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710352007:1":{"text":"私もです、殿下！屋敷の書斎で、祭典の支出報告を確認していて……","source_cn":"我也是！殿下！我当时正在府邸的书房内，审阅庆典开支报表……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB354393BB9A2B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710352008:1":{"text":"羽ペンを手に取った瞬間、目の前が真っ暗になったのです。いつもの持病かと思ったのですが、目を開けたら、ここの床に座っていたんですよ！","source_cn":"我刚拿起羽毛笔，只觉得眼前一黑，还以为自己老毛病犯了！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA51CC135A761D4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710352009:1":{"text":"王女様、先ほどからここに隠れて周りを観察していたのですが……","source_cn":"公主殿下，我刚才躲在这里观察了许久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF87A1C0657684A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710352010:1":{"text":"建築スタイルと、並べられた棺桶を見るに……もしや、ここは<style=\"highlight\">古聖堂</style>なのですか？","source_cn":"这陈列的棺椁，还有内饰的风格……如果我没看错的话……这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788E587945949C0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710352011:1":{"text":"ええ、ここは古聖堂の中よ。","source_cn":"没错，这里是圣古堂内部。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD70337E37F85165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710352012:1":{"text":"ああ、デューラ様！あの報告は本当だったのですね！実はつい先ほど、うちの記者が広場から知らせを送ってきたのです。あなたと、そこの宮廷魔術師様が古聖堂に入った後……","source_cn":"艾雅啊，原来那个急报是真的！公主殿下，就在刚才，我的记...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ECCC8324DC02C90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710352013:1":{"text":"みんなの目の前で、古聖堂が忽然と<style=\"highlight\">消えてしまった</style>と！","source_cn":"整个圣古堂，在众目睽睽之下，<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C310DDDD9E5C05D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710352014:1":{"text":"消えた？","source_cn":"消失了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8394E1878D7F2817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710352015:1":{"text":"私たちが古聖堂に入った後に？","source_cn":"在我们踏入圣古堂之后？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB88F59023A4C5D18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710352016:1":{"text":"ええ、そうです！直ちにこの大スクープを一面に載せようと版を組んでいたら、まさか自分がここに来てしまうなんて……","source_cn":"是的！我正准备要把这个惊天头条排上版面，结果自己也进来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x620C4A8E6919DA3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710352017:1":{"text":"つまり、外と遮断されたわけではなく……古聖堂そのものが、どこかへ転送されてしまったということですね。","source_cn":"原来并非我和公主被传送……而是整座圣古堂连同内部空间一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A11F1552BC72D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710352018:1":{"text":"ペギー様、ルドルフさんの話が本当なら、ここは単なる「閉鎖空間」ではありません。","source_cn":"殿下，如果伦道夫主编说的是真的，那这就不是简单的“封门”了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF1A9827962FA3C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710352019:1":{"text":"古聖堂ほどの質量を持つ物体を転送するには、途方もない魔力が必要です。それだけでなく、事前に最上位の魔法陣を用意しなくてはなりません……","source_cn":"……要把圣古堂这种体量的存在从现实空间转移，这需要的巨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x031079C255D8357E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710352020:1":{"text":"ようするに、念入りに仕組まれた罠ってことね。","source_cn":"看来，这是一个精心设计的陷阱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46F146CF2BE04D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710352021:1":{"text":"わ、罠ですって！？私たち、死んでしまうの？いやっ、死にたくないっ！","source_cn":"陷阱？！那我们会死吗？我不想死啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF44DD0C66F062F72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710352022:1":{"text":"そんな！まだやり残したことがたくさんあるのに！","source_cn":"不要吧，我什么都没做啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE82CA76F5FD8A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1710352023:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">静かに！</style>鎧に気付かれてもいいの！","source_cn":"<style=highlight>安静！</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7DFA36235B32780","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1710352024:1":{"text":"ペギーの気迫に押され、貴族たちは一瞬で黙り込んだ。外の足音は一瞬ためらうように止まったが、やがてゆっくりと遠ざかっていった。","source_cn":"贵族们被佩吉的气势震慑，瞬间安静下来，只有恐惧的呼吸声...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88E940A7E925BE55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1710352025:1":{"text":"いい？焦っても何も解決しないし、命を危険にさらすだけよ。だから一緒に助かる方法を探しましょう。ペギー・オーガスタの名にかけて、決してあなたたちを見捨てないと誓うわ。","source_cn":"听着。现在慌乱解决不了任何问题，只会让我们送命。既然我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8AEED216CB7D029","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docum